# Change Log
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
and this project adheryou des to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).

## [Unreleased]

## [Released]
## [0.2.1] - 2026-02-25
### Added
- Added Skopeo example file for my-web-app helm chart

## [0.2.0] - 2026-02-19
### Added
- Added Kyverno Operator
- Added ClusterPolicy to automatically generate VPA objects for namespaces
- Added VPA Dashboard

## [0.1.0] - 2026-02-12
### Added
- Added ArgoCD connectivity to cluster via bootstrap app
- Added ArgoCD ApplicationProject for openshift4-community
- Added ArgoCD ApplicationSet for openshift4-appset
- Added ArgoCD Application for my-sno-cluster
- Added gitignore to ignore all files except tracked files

### Changed
- Updated grafana dashboard file names and references
- Updated grafana kustomization to set namespace to openshift-operators via kustomization.yaml
- Updated grafana generate_dashboards.sh to set namespace to grafana
- Updated README.md with git branch creation instructions
- Updated docs template structure

### Removed
- Removed stackrox base from my-sno-cluster overlay kustomization.yaml
- Removed stackrox charts

## [0.0.7] - 2026-02-11
### Added
- Added helm skeleton "my-web-app"

## [0.0.6] - 2026-02-11
### Changed
- Fix Grafana/README.md table of content link 

## [0.0.5] - 2026-02-10
### Changed
- Updated Grafana/README.md with images

## [0.0.4] - 2026-02-10
